Package: nddspiro2
Title: Extract and Tidy Data from ndd Spirometry XML Files
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Nengjie", family = "He", email = "n.he@imperial.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools to parse raw XML files generated by ndd
    medical spirometry devices. It extracts patient metadata, trial
    information, and parameter values (FEV1, FVC, etc.) into a tidy
    'data.table' format for easy analysis.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    data.table,
    xml2
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
Config/testthat/edition: 3
